00:04:51.221 --> 00:04:52.221
Can you help me?

00:04:52.221 --> 00:04:53.350
You should introduce me to this person here.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.720
Hey, I'm serious about wanting to do this,
I'm going to make an impact with my life,

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.920
I need your help.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.500
Keep using that script because it works to
