00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.030
Next, logic [older], emotion [younger].

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.130
You know what sells?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.690
Emotion sells.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:21.620
Now, you've got to definitely be looking at
the logical sides of business, contracts and

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:23.880
all that other stuff, but emotions sell.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:25.890
Emotions speak here [the heart].

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.380
Logic speaks here [the head].

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.380
Okay?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:31.310
Opportunity sometimes everything they go through
and want to look at the numbers and all this

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.310
stuff?

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:33.310
Yes.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.310
Logic.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:35.930
Like, for instance, if you're dealing with
venture capital and you're dealing with money

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.950
people, they don't care about how emotional
