numbers, what if this grows, what if that
grows?

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.700
Okay, we'll give a quarter million bucks at
10%, whatever.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.700
That's how they'll work.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:56.200
So if you're younger and watching this, don't
expect the investors to be too emotional with

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:57.200
you -- they're not.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:02.040
But there are a lot of benefits to being emotional.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.690
Next, nothing to lose [young], lots to lose
[older].

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:08.460
Just so you know, this [nothing to lose] is
your edge.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.750
This is your edge, if you're watching this.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.740
This is a very big edge, when you have nothing
to lose.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:17.750
Who is the scariest person to fight in the
