00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.330
Do you know what it is?

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.610
You know what it is?

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:42.630
Not married, not good with parents or parents
are dead, no siblings, no kids, no nothing.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.630
Why?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:44.640
There are no ties.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.960
You have nothing to lose.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.460
So you make a better CIA agent.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.370
You make a better FBI agent.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:51.370
