00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:20.520
an attorney for them [younger] if I'm representing
them.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.520
I'm not taking sides.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:24.430
I'm just telling you what your leverage is
here.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:29.240
Now, I will tell you, the younger and the
older entrepreneurs here that are watching

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:35.580
