00:09:25.529 --> 00:09:26.610
So I watch discipline.

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:27.610
#2: Delivery.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.870
If you say you're going to deliver, deliver
on time.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:35.339
If you say you're going to deliver on whatever
promises, deliver on it.

00:09:35.339 --> 00:09:38.060
