00:09:42.509 --> 00:09:44.630
Next, product knowledge.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.949
Know everything about whatever you're selling.

00:09:47.949 --> 00:09:50.069
Know everything about whatever you're selling.

00:09:50.069 --> 00:09:51.069
Everything.

00:09:51.069 --> 00:09:54.110
Whatever you can, immerse yourself in that
product.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:59.550
Just absolutely get obsessed about learning
